        </a></dd>

        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>human & animal; = manner of eating or feeding: differentiate from <a href="/record/ui?ui=D004435" class="textLink_EATING">EATING</a>, the act of eating or feeding; permitted for feeding behavior of insects, as mosquitoes on skin, ticks sucking blood, maggots on flesh, etc., but NIM with feeding organism IM</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Behavioral responses or sequences associated with eating including modes of feeding, rhythmic patterns of eating, and time intervals.</dd>
                </span>
            
